        "original_id": "1fa5b997-183c-525d-9ced-70c3805ff5a7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ralph Tresvant, Chad Smith, Sammy Hagar, Michael Anthony, Joe Satriani\n- Groups: New Edition, Red Hot Chili Peppers, Chickenfoot, Van Halen, Montrose\n- Songs: \"Stone Cold Gentleman\"\n- Albums: Ralph Tresvant's eponymous debut album\n\nFacts:\n- Chad Smith joined the Red Hot Chili Peppers in 1988.\n- Chadwick Gaylord Smith, born October 25, 1961, is an American musician and the current drummer of the Red Hot Chili Peppers.\n- Ralph Edward Tresvant Sr., born May 16, 1968, is also known as Rizz and Rizzo.\n- Ralph Tresvant is an American contemporary R&B singer best known as the lead singer of New Edition.\n- \"Stone Cold Gentleman\" is a song performed by Ralph Tresvant.\n- \"Stone Cold Gentleman\" was issued as the second single from Ralph Tresvant's eponymous debut album.\n- Chickenfoot consists of Sammy Hagar, Michael Anthony, Joe Satriani, and Chad Smith.\n- Sammy Hagar is a former member of Van Halen and Montrose, and Michael Anthony is also a former member of Van Halen.",
